{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Machinery.HeckeH4StabilizationRung","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeH4StabilizationRung","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Machinery.MarkovTraceOnHecke"],"declarations":18,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.trM4_markov_σ₂","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.trM4_markov_σ₂","kind":"theorem","line":171,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4StabilizationRung.lean#L171-L177","doc":"**The (M3) Markov reduction at the new rung**: `tr₄((ι x)·σ₂) = z·tr₃ x`\nfor every `x ∈ H₃`. Together with `trM4_iota34_stabilizes` this is the\ncomplete concrete content of the `n = 3 → 4` stabilization step. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.trM4_iota34_stabilizes","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.trM4_iota34_stabilizes","kind":"theorem","line":163,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4StabilizationRung.lean#L163-L169","doc":"**The H₃ ↪ H₄ Markov stabilization, Lean-grade**: `tr₄(ι x) = tr₃ x`.\nThis is the `n = 3 → 4` case `MarkovTraceOnHecke` recorded as numerically\nconfirmed and Lean-blocked on the H₄ table — now proved. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.iota34_mulσ₁","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.iota34_mulσ₁","kind":"theorem","line":157,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4StabilizationRung.lean#L157-L161","doc":"The inclusion intertwines the σ₁ actions: `ι(x)·σ₁ = ι(x·σ₁)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.iota34_mulσ₀","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.iota34_mulσ₀","kind":"theorem","line":151,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4StabilizationRung.lean#L151-L155","doc":"The inclusion intertwines the σ₀ actions: `ι(x)·σ₀ = ι(x·σ₀)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.iota34","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.iota34","kind":"def","line":144,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4StabilizationRung.lean#L144-L149","doc":"The `H₃ ↪ H₄` inclusion on NF coordinates: the 24-basis is ordered with\nthe H₃ Lean basis `[γ, σ₀, σ₁, L₊, L₋, e⁻]` as its prefix, so the inclusion\nextends by zero. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.far_commute_σ₀σ₂","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.far_commute_σ₀σ₂","kind":"theorem","line":134,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4StabilizationRung.lean#L134-L140","doc":"**Far commutation `σ₀σ₂ = σ₂σ₀`** — the F1 monoidal-interchange shadow,\nnon-vacuous for the FIRST time at n = 4 (at n ≤ 3 there is no non-adjacent\npair). Until now this presentation law existed only as a class field. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.braid_σ₁σ₂","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.braid_σ₁σ₂","kind":"theorem","line":128,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4StabilizationRung.lean#L128-L132","doc":"Braid relation `σ₁σ₂σ₁ = σ₂σ₁σ₂` at level 4. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.braid_σ₀σ₁","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.braid_σ₀σ₁","kind":"theorem","line":122,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4StabilizationRung.lean#L122-L126","doc":"Braid relation `σ₀σ₁σ₀ = σ₁σ₀σ₁` at level 4. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ₂_hecke","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ₂_hecke","kind":"theorem","line":115,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4StabilizationRung.lean#L115-L120","doc":"Hecke quadratic for σ₂ at level 4. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ₁_hecke","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ₁_hecke","kind":"theorem","line":108,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4StabilizationRung.lean#L108-L113","doc":"Hecke quadratic for σ₁ at level 4. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ₀_hecke","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ₀_hecke","kind":"theorem","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4StabilizationRung.lean#L101-L106","doc":"Hecke quadratic for σ₀ at level 4: `σ₀² = h·σ₀ + 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.trM4_smul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.trM4_smul","kind":"theorem","line":95,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4StabilizationRung.lean#L95-L99","doc":"(M1) Homogeneity — the `trM4` counterpart of `MarkovTraceH4.trM_smul`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.trM4_add","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.trM4_add","kind":"theorem","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4StabilizationRung.lean#L90-L93","doc":"(M1) Additivity — the `trM4` counterpart of `MarkovTraceH4.trM_add`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.trM4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.trM4","kind":"def","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4StabilizationRung.lean#L87-L88","doc":"The level-4 Markov trace: `v ↦ ∑ᵢ vᵢ · TRM4ᵢ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.TRM4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.TRM4","kind":"def","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4StabilizationRung.lean#L74-L85","doc":"Markov–Ocneanu–Wenzl weights on the 24-element basis — the UNIQUE\nsolution of cyclicity + Markov-σ₂ reduction + `tr(1)=1` (preflight-derived;\nfirst six = the H₃ weights). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ₂","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ₂","kind":"def","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4StabilizationRung.lean#L65-L72","doc":"Right action of `σ₂` on the 24-element S₄ NF basis (preflight-pinned). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ₁","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ₁","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4StabilizationRung.lean#L56-L63","doc":"Right action of `σ₁` on the 24-element S₄ NF basis (preflight-pinned). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ₀","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ₀","kind":"def","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4StabilizationRung.lean#L47-L54","doc":"Right action of `σ₀` on the 24-element S₄ NF basis (preflight-pinned). ","signatureChunk":0}]}